OL,3,GNEWSATracking function on stolen
OL,4,Adevices helps catch thief
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thief who stole digital devices was
OL,7,Fcaught after his victims used tracking
OL,8,Ftechnology that helped police pinpoint
OL,9,Fhis location.
OL,11,FRichard Riley, 42, broke into a house
OL,12,Fin the Boscombe area of Bournemouth in
OL,13,FJune and took an iPad, MacBook Pro Air,
OL,14,Ftwo power banks and a pair of Bluetooth
OL,15,Fheadphones - all while the home's
OL,16,Foccupants were sleeping.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
