OL,3,GNEWSATracking function on stolen
OL,4,Adevices helps catch thief
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tracking function on one of the
OL,7,Fdevices led officers from Dorset Police
OL,8,Fdirectly to Riley, who was also in
OL,9,Fpossession of the victims' credit cards
OL,10,Fand was found wearing trainers that
OL,11,Fmatched footmarks at the scene.
OL,13,FRiley, of no fixed abode, admitted
OL,14,Fburglary and was jailed at Bournemouth
OL,15,FCrown Court on Thursday for three years
OL,16,Fand one month.
